  "content": "<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/563928/description_8b75b5f3-9883-4d6c-b3e8-b6d98a89fa51.png\" alt=\"TerraBlender 標誌\" width=\"336\" height=\"160\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/563928/description_97be718f-501b-4058-bf35-a59c798f3631.png\" alt=\"Glitchfiend 標誌\" width=\"165\" height=\"34\"> &nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ffiles.minecraftforge.net%252fnet%252fminecraftforge%252fforge%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/563928/description_283579fd-370d-4cea-9dbb-fbd374e5bb7c.png\" alt=\"Forge 標誌\" width=\"174\" height=\"32\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/GyyzU6T\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/563928/description_ac771a61-5607-4adf-ad96-3d8e16a42010.png\" alt=\"加入我們的 Discord\" width=\"212\" height=\"38\"></a></p><h1>描述</h1><hr><h4>TerraBlender 是一個模組庫，用於以簡單且相容的方式，在 Minecraft 新的生態域/地形系統中新增生態域。</h4><p style=\"font-size:1px\">&nbsp;</p><h1>開發者</h1><hr><h3>關於如何使用 TerraBlender API 的文件，請參閱 <a href=\"https://github.com/Glitchfiend/TerraBlender/wiki/Getting-started\" rel=\"nofollow\">TerraBlender  Wiki</a></h3><p style=\"font-size:1px\">&nbsp;</p><h1>連結</h1><hr><ul>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://twitter.com/TheAdubbz\" rel=\"nofollow\">在 Twitter 上追蹤我</a></strong></li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://www.paypal.com/donate/?business=AdubbzG@gmail.com&amp;item_name=TerraBlender (from CurseForge.com)&amp;cy_code=USD\" rel=\"nofollow\">透過 PayPal 捐款</a></strong></li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/Adubbz\" rel=\"nofollow\">在 Patreon 上贊助我</a></strong></li>\n</ul><p style=\"font-size:1px\">&nbsp;</p><h1>其他模組載入器版本</h1><hr><ul>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/terrablender-neoforge\" rel=\"nofollow\">適用於 NeoForge 的 TerraBlender</a></strong></li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/terrablender-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\">適用於 Fabric 的 TerraBlender</a></strong></li>\n</ul>",
